select 'sociological-theory', 'Conflict theories', 'While many conflict theories set out to highlight the ideological aspects inherent in traditional thought, conflict theory does not refer to a unified school of thought, and should not be confused with, for instance, social conflict theory, or any other specific theory related to social conflict.', 'Wikipedia: Conflict theories', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Conflict_theories&oldid=1375940212', 'CC BY-SA 4.0. Wikipedia contributors (see page history). Excerpted and split into passages.'
